entries:
Gates are placed at the border of one
space and another space.{VAR BE01}
In other words, gates mean that the
world beyond here is a different world.{VAR BE01}
It does feel like every time you pass
through a gate, you're going to a{VAR BE00}
different world.{VAR BE01}
And you remember the Gym Leader who
gave you the Badge at the same time...{VAR BE01}
But without the Quake Badge,
you cannot proceed.
